We come outside the club building after the badminton game.
There is a tea vendor nearby.
Amit, Neha, Sanjay, and I go there.
Amit says, "Sir, please give four cups of cutting chai."
We take the tea and drink it.
Now we are good friends.
Sanjay smiles and asks me.
"Maya, you came to Mumbai from Mexico."
"When did you come?"
Neha also asks.
"Yes, why did you come here?"
They say 'tvam' (you) for the first time.
I am very happy.
I say, "I came here in January."
"I got a software job here."
"Therefore I came to Mumbai."
Amit drinks tea and asks.
"What all did you do in the beginning?"
"Please tell the whole story."
I remember my first day in Mumbai.
I tell my story.
